# First class change (FirstClassChange): a level 20 human fighter holding the medallion of the
# Warrior asks Grand Master Ramos about the Warrior and changes profession: the medallion is
# taken, fifteen D-grade coupons given, the fanfare played, then the class change's own
# animation and message, and the congratulation page. After a relog the character plays the
# Warrior, so Ramos says it has already changed profession. Expectations are the reference
# trace's (FirstClassChange.onTalk, onAdvEvent).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/first_class_change_warrior.golden
character Fighter 20
hold 1145 1
script script.feature.FirstClassChange
item 1145 8869
page villagemaster/30373.htm
page script/feature/FirstClassChange/
npc ramos 30373 VillageMasterFighter 10 0 0

action ramos
action ramos
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 page=villagemaster/30373.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{ramos}_Quest FirstClassChange
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 page=script/feature/FirstClassChange/30373-08.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest FirstClassChange 30373-09.htm
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 page=script/feature/FirstClassChange/30373-09.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest FirstClassChange HW
  S SystemMessage id=302 3:1145
  S SystemMessage id=53 3:8869 6:15
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_fanfare_2 bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=player skill=5103-1 hit=1000 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=1308
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 page=script/feature/FirstClassChange/30373-29.htm
  S ActionFailed
  items 1145=0 8869=15
relog
  items 1145=0 8869=15
action ramos
action ramos
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 page=villagemaster/30373.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{ramos}_Quest FirstClassChange
